    "secondary": [
      "finite-instance-classification"
    ]
  },
  "failure_conditions": [
    "A second class without solutions; a class of the glue without some line whose row equals the contradictory class's; a tie of the removed line's points in another class; a non-degenerate two-point partner; or, at a line with no two-point partner, a second class whose degenerate entries include the contradictory class's."
  ],
